OL,3,GNEWSATributes paid to dementia charity
OL,4,Aco-founder
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe wrote and published books about the
OL,7,Fsyndrome and for more than 35 years she
OL,8,F"championed a simple idea: that
OL,9,Fdementia care should see the whole
OL,10,Fperson, not the condition", a
OL,11,Fspokesperson from the charity said.
